msgstr "与 Navio+ 相比的新特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:49
#: 0aef10a8b3d24081af9d96ecbfe7f68a 19cac4cbeb0d41f88679bde91af563b8
#: 42253620876e489ebd194da0023993a1 88bdee76d2274414a3b3d15e8d31c2a9
#: 8bb5487a3277442ead32f99db2ba0750 f9a2e91049de466a92ab3dcfc37c27f4
msgid ""
"**Dual IMU.** Navio2 has two IMU chips to improve flight experience and for "
"redundancy."
msgstr "**双 IMU。** Navio2 配备了两块 IMU 芯片，可提升飞行体验并实现冗余。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:51
#: 16a11d8c53e5462c844a287e582d6acd 1ee407e9183847f5ad1df2ade1393703
#: 4c0f3943366d44fbb3fd41ce94d12cb1 69da5a26aa6047a8b898ee14140f3d66
#: bdefcd6f680548d18eedf092678c5402 c7333519f79c475ea1c1a0aaafbd911d
msgid ""
"**Improved MS5611 performance.** Transactions from other chips on the bus, "
"which MS5611 is connected to, can produce noise during the conversion. "
"That's why MS5611 was left the only sensor on the I2C bus to overcome this."
msgstr ""
"**改进的 MS5611 性能。** 与 MS5611 连接的同一总线上其他芯片的数据传输会在转换过程中产生噪声。因此，MS5611 被单独保留在 "
"I2C 总线上以解决此问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:53
#: 3985580315684703a3633768a9f532cb 3a3c980a72364932ad0c38e00fb015f7
#: 4287ac53a3564e1185a8ae96c4f19f78 8a3501841ba14b0bbaa9fb436d8a4317
#: 8f829a30d1cb466dba120a1bb283129a b4d7438083d34df5814d8f4487c1d4c3
msgid ""
"**PCA9685 PWM generator replaced with a microcontroller.** On previous Navio"
" version PWM generation was handled by PCA9685 chip. Main limitation of this"
" chip is the inability to control frequencies for separate channels. This "
"leads to problems with motors and servos that work on different frequencies."
" To eliminate that problem a microcontroller is used. It allows to set "
"frequencies for output channels by groups."
msgstr ""
"**PCA9685 PWM 发生器被微控制器取代。** 旧版 Navio 的 PWM 生成由 PCA9685 "
"芯片处理。该芯片的主要限制是无法为不同通道单独设置频率，导致电机和舵机（工作频率不同）出现问题。为解决这一问题，改用微控制器，可按组设置输出通道的频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:55
#: 31eb8b7e77f344a4a215a7a6239fe98c 54b597d8e5f64cab947a16b3918ba7d2
#: d5acaccf6b1741c0a7a054257ff1339f da2ffa89e341473ba077a9011ab3a081
#: e5cd382b210747f7a117d534654649dd fbc9ea3b33394a4a8bf3512052d8be48
msgid ""
"**PPM/SBUS decoding done by microcontroller instead of DMA.**  Navio+ used "
"DMA to sample PPM signal which was quite heavy on system resources. On "
"Navio2 a microcontroller handles PPM/SBUS sampling leaving processor cores "
"of Raspberry Pi 2 for your tasks."
msgstr ""
"**PPM/SBUS 解码改由微控制器完成而非 DMA。** Navio+ 使用 DMA 采样 PPM 信号，对系统资源消耗较大。Navio2 "
"使用微控制器处理 PPM/SBUS 采样，释放了 Raspberry Pi 2 的处理器核心供其他任务使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:57
#: 53c3cf57f7da4b7fba333dbf724a17ec 596b57edc2ae4f84b4ccaf47a7924663
#: 87cf871cb0944dd28e48ec7ba9308a87 9d1fcbfceef14e64a1e2235239a2d446
#: b04f0f185e8d46e8b92f0783783aeac8 fbae22acf7db4b7e9d38005d2f01e47d
msgid ""
"**AUX SPI.** Navio2 is the first HAT to utilize AUX SPI controller on "
"Raspberry Pi. Using two SPI controllers allows to distribute sensors more "
"efficiently."
msgstr ""
"**AUX SPI。** Navio2 是首款使用 Raspberry Pi AUX SPI 控制器的 HAT。双 SPI "
"控制器可以更高效地分配传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:59
#: 23e2a210f4f942f6b4f54f234ca328bc 429ac3f07e8947fd90a774a8dcbceb75
#: 59f4473ed3c64f609892bffc212a7b7e b464bd9b86044725acec2a3951660e20
#: b50c03335e394265b6281e463c9d8bbf bc928047893e4ada923a69043ded5522
msgid ""
"**ADC port.** Using additional ADC channels on Navio+ was not user friendly "
"due to ADC channels being only available on pads at the bottom of the board."
" On Navio2 these channels are easily accessible on a DF13 port."
msgstr ""
"**ADC 端口。** 在 Navio+ 上使用额外的 ADC 通道不够友好，因为 ADC 通道仅在板底部的焊盘上可用。Navio2 将这些通道引出至 "
"DF13 接口，方便访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-navio2-overview.rst:61
#: 08882bbbc659469caf1f64a48db32692 7016b3fe4a664eb0b23329b866692795
#: c999229efe7f465abcb93df7604b71b5 ed9d0bb2a4024cb6a8f69b01108fa383
#: f2ad7344aef0402ca41cf34f2d84df57 f7832dbdbc88402abb1d17a9c14ae92f
msgid ""
"**Better Linux integration.** PWM, ADC, SBUS and PPM are integrated in Linux"
" sysfs allowing for easy access from any programming language. Even deeper "
"integration is coming in the future."
msgstr ""
"**更好的 Linux 集成。** PWM、ADC、SBUS 和 PPM 均已集成至 Linux "
"sysfs，可从任何编程语言方便访问。未来还将进行更深度的集成。"

